# Apollo Plugin Marketplace

- Keep Claude Code and Codex plugin packaging in sync.
- Every published plugin must have `plugins/<plugin>/.claude-plugin/plugin.json` and `plugins/<plugin>/.codex-plugin/plugin.json`.
- `plugin.json` `name` must match the plugin directory exactly.
- Add or remove plugins from both `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json` and `.agents/plugins/marketplace.json` in the same change.
- Codex marketplace entries need `policy.installation`, `policy.authentication`, and `category`.
- Codex manifests should include `skills: "./skills/"` when `skills/` exists and `mcpServers: "./.mcp.json"` only when `.mcp.json` exists.
- Do not manually edit generated skill inventory tables in README.md or SKILL_INVENTORY.md.
